 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.148
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "AI 不是一类新漏洞，它是一个放大器。",
   "spoken": "AI 不是一类新漏洞，它是一个放大器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.58,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 3.679,
   "speechEnd": 6.874
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "它让攻击者写钓鱼更快，伪造视频更像，找合约漏洞更便宜。",
   "spoken": "它让攻击者写钓鱼更快，伪造视频更像，找合约漏洞更便宜。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 7.32,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 7.413,
   "speechEnd": 12.982
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "它也让防御者审计得更广，监控得更快。",
   "spoken": "它也让防御者审计得更广，监控得更快。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 13.38,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 13.471,
   "speechEnd": 16.953
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "真正新的部分，只有一个。",
   "spoken": "真正新的部分，只有一个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 17.44,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 17.538,
   "speechEnd": 19.664
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "当 AI 智能体自己拿着钱包，说服它，就成了转走资产的方法。",
   "spoken": "当 AI 智能体自己拿着钱包，说服它，就成了转走资产的方法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 20.06,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 20.06,
   "speechEnd": 25.256
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "AI 智能体，是能调用工具、执行操作的大语言模型程序。",
   "spoken": "AI 智能体，是能掉用工具、执行操作的大语言模型程序。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 25.64,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 25.736,
   "speechEnd": 30.538
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "比如自动交易的机器人，或者自动回复并打赏的机器人。",
   "spoken": "比如自动交易的机器人，或者自动回复并打赏的机器人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 30.98,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 31.081,
   "speechEnd": 35.689
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "攻击它最直接的办法，叫提示注入。",
   "spoken": "攻击它最直接的办法，叫提示注入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 36.08,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 36.08,
   "speechEnd": 38.836
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "把指令藏在模型会读到的内容里，让模型去执行攻击者的意图。",
   "spoken": "把指令藏在模型会读到的内容里，让模型去执行攻击者的意图。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 39.26,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 39.36,
   "speechEnd": 45.06
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "打个比方，你雇了一个能干、但极其听话的新助理，还把公司的支付卡交给了他。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，你雇了一个能干、但极其听话的新助理，还把公司的支付卡交给了他。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 45.48,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 45.575,
   "speechEnd": 52.255
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "任何人走进办公室，塞给他一张纸条，写着老板说把钱转给我，他都可能照做。",
   "spoken": "任何人走进办公室，塞给他一张纸条，写着老板说把钱转给我，他都可能照做。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 52.66,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 52.754,
   "speechEnd": 59.035
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "问题不在助理不够聪明，而在你把支付卡，交给了一个会被纸条说服的人。",
   "spoken": "问题不在助理不够聪明，而在你把支付卡，交给了一个会被纸条说服的人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 59.44,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 59.44,
   "speechEnd": 65.356
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 65.82,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 65.913,
   "speechEnd": 67.414
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "真实的助理，会记得谁是老板。",
   "spoken": "真实的助理，会记得谁是老板。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 67.88,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 67.88,
   "speechEnd": 70.281
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "智能体的记忆，本身也可能被人写进假内容。",
   "spoken": "智能体的记忆，本身也可能被人写进假内容。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 70.66,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 70.763,
   "speechEnd": 74.198
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "按 AI 站在哪一边，可以分成五个方向。",
   "spoken": "按 AI 站在哪一边，可以分成五个方向。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 74.64,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 74.64,
   "speechEnd": 77.69
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "AI 是目标，比如持有钱包的智能体。",
   "spoken": "AI 是目标，比如持有钱包的智能体。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 78.14,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 78.24,
   "speechEnd": 81.473
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "AI 是攻击工具，一边对着人，一边对着代码。",
   "spoken": "AI 是攻击工具，一边对着人，一边对着代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 81.88,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 81.985,
   "speechEnd": 86.099
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "AI 是开发工具，写合约，写配置，装插件。",
   "spoken": "AI 是开发工具，写合约，写配置，装插件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 86.5,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 86.594,
   "speechEnd": 90.537
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "AI 也是防御工具，做审计初筛和监控告警。",
   "spoken": "AI 也是防御工具，做审计初筛和监控告警。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-20.wav",
   "start": 90.96,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 91.062,
   "speechEnd": 94.926
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "先看最新的那一个，持有钱包的智能体。",
   "spoken": "先看最新的那一个，持有钱包的智能体。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg2-21.wav",
